WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:10.143
In tutorial 1.3, you'll add
the website you want to grow,

00:00:10.193 --> 00:00:12.140
and say where its customers search.

00:00:13.191 --> 00:00:17.801
First, type your website address, or check
the one filled in from the step before.

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:23.400
Next, choose the main country
your customers search from.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:27.392
Rankings, keyword searches and
AI answers are checked there.

00:00:28.356 --> 00:00:31.631
Then, if you like, say what
you do in a sentence or two.

00:00:31.681 --> 00:00:33.675
You'll add the rest in the business step.

00:00:36.406 --> 00:00:41.031
Next, a quick check. If what you do
names places outside your main country,

00:00:41.081 --> 00:00:45.259
like Riyadh and Jeddah here, Add
website opens Check this first.

00:00:46.263 --> 00:00:51.363
Your main country decides where rankings,
searches and AI answers are measured.

00:00:51.413 --> 00:00:54.788
Make the suggested country
your main one, or tick Keep.

00:00:54.838 --> 00:00:56.403
Cancel changes nothing.

00:00:57.372 --> 00:01:00.127
When the details match, click Add website.

00:01:00.177 --> 00:01:03.870
Next, you confirm that you own
it, and series two shows you how.

00:01:04.839 --> 00:01:09.919
Pick one way: Verify with Google,
Add a DNS record, or Add a meta tag.

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:12.625
Or click Skip for now, and verify later.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.820
So, type your website address, choose
the main country, say what you do,

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:20.596
check the country matches,
and add the website.

00:01:21.521 --> 00:01:26.669
Your website is added. Next, describe
your business in tutorial 1.4.
